'''Pokémon Adventures: The Final Challenge!''' is the eighteenth monthly issue released by [[VIZ Media]] of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga created by [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and [[Mato]]. It contains chapter forty of the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}. The chapter originally released in this book was later rereleased as part of {{PAV|3}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

